  "help_text": "Ctrl+S  Save\nCtrl+Shift+S / F4  Save as\nCtrl+O  Open file\nCtrl+N  New tab\nCtrl+W  Close tab\nCtrl+Tab / F6  Next tab\nCtrl+E  Focus file browser/editor\n↑ ↓ Enter  Browse/open · Backspace  Parent directory\nCtrl+T  Create file\nCtrl+D  Create directory\nCtrl+F  Find · F3  Next match\nShift + movement  Select text\nCtrl+A / C / X / V  All / copy / cut / paste\nCtrl+Z / Ctrl+Y  Undo / redo\nCtrl+R  Format with rustfmt\nCtrl+B  Cargo check (saved files)\nCtrl+P  Files · Ctrl+Shift+P / Ctrl+G  Commands\nCtrl+Alt+P  Projects · Ctrl+Alt+O  Open project\nF5  Reload plugins\nF2  Rename file/folder in Explorer or symbol in editor\nF1  Help · F8  Build output\nCtrl+Q  Quit\n\nType to edit. Tab inserts four spaces.\nShift+Insert / terminal paste inserts clipboard text.\nUse --plugins PATH to load your own plugins.\n\nMouse: click cursor/tab; double-click file/word.\nDrag to select; wheel to scroll.\nShift + wheel scrolls horizontally.\nClick ↑ .. for the parent directory.\n\nF7  MD preview / Source\nF9  Mermaid\n\n\nCtrl+G — Commands\nF10 — Terminal\nF11 — Run\nCtrl+F11 — Build\nF12 — Go to definition\nCtrl+Space — Completion\nF2 / Delete in the file browser: rename / delete with confirmation.\nRight-click a file or folder in Explorer to open its actions menu.",
